# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for unit tests.
#
# Readers access node fields without locks and validate them with node versions
# afterward (seqlock-style optimistic reads). Such reads race with writers by
# design, so suppress races involving node classes.
race:dbgroup::index::b_tree::component::NodeHeader
race:dbgroup::index::b_tree::component::InnerNode
race:dbgroup::index::b_tree::component::LeafNode
